{"text": "1611 E. Bougainvillea Ave, Tampa, FL 33612, Phone: 813-971-6761\n\nThomas Atchison\n\nExperience\n\n1998 - Current New Beginnings of Tampa, Inc Tampa, FL\n\nExecutive Director/CEO\n\n* Reports to the Board of Directors and have overall strategic and operational responsibility for\nNew Beginnings of Tampa, Inc., staff, programs, expansions and executive of its mission.\n= Ensure ongoing local programmatic excellence, rigorous program evaluation, and consistent\nquality of finance and administration, fundraising, communications, and systems; recommend\ntimelines and recourses needed to achieve the strategic goals.\n= Actively engage and energize New Beginnings of Tampa\u2019s volunteers, board members, event\ncommittees, organizations, and funders.\n\"Develop, maintain, and support a strong Board of Directors; seek and build board involvement\nwith strategic direction for ongoing local operations.\n= Lead, coach, develop, and retain New Beginnings high-performance management team. Ensure\neffective systems to track scaling progress, and regularly evaluate program components, so as to\nmeasure successes that can be effectively communicated to the board, funders, and other\n\nconstituents.\nr = Expand local revenue generation and fundraising activities to support existing program\noperations.\n= Use external presence and relationships to gamer new opportunities.\n= Design and complete the strategic business planning process for the program expansion into new\nmarkets.\n\n1994 - 1998 Capital Mortgage Tampa, FL\n\nReal Estate Broker\n\n= Solicit potential clients to buy, sell, and rent properties.\n\u00ab Advise clients on prices, mortgages, market conditions, and other related information.\n= Compare properties to determine a competitive market price.\n= Generate lists of properties for sale, including details such as location and features.\n= Promote properties through advertisements, open houses, and listing services.\n= Take prospective buyers or renters to see properties.\n= Present purchase offers to sellers for consideration.\n= Mediate negotiations between the buyers and the seller.\n= Ensure all terms of purchase contracts are met.\n= Prepare documents, such as loyalty contracts, purchase agreements, and deeds.\n\nReal Estate Brokerage License \u2014 State of\nEducation Florida - 1994\nr Degree \u2014 Berean Bible College \u2014 Th.D -\n\n1992",
